00:38:00.700 --> 00:38:06.000
I, at first, I wasn't clear on, like, that it's diagonally adjacent works also.

00:38:06.180 --> 00:38:12.700
Because the way that the grid is laid out, anything that you're adjacent to not diagonally, they're a lot closer to each other.

00:38:12.700 --> 00:38:15.740
Because the space diagonally between them is a lot larger.

00:38:15.960 --> 00:38:17.680
So they, that was confusing at first.

00:38:17.760 --> 00:38:20.020
But once I figured that, I think I got the gist.

00:38:20.780 --> 00:38:23.500
Yeah, no, it was, it wasn't, like, black magic.

00:38:23.960 --> 00:38:25.300
I, it was pretty simple.

00:38:25.980 --> 00:38:27.660
